## Who this is from, and what I checked

I am the **internal code reviewer for PR-1** (`ta-anchor-refactor-v2` / PR #1516). This is not a
PR-2 review and not a planner task report. My job here was a **post-merge verification**: PR-1 is
merged, so I checked what PR-1 *actually landed in `main`* against what PR-1 was reviewed and
planned to land, and then measured how the merged result lands on PR-2's branch.

Everything below is read-only findings. **I made no code changes, no plan edits, and no CURRENT.md
edits** — those are yours (or the coder's) to make. This handoff is the deliverable.

Verification was done against `upstream/main@d5d58640`, PR-1 head `a38d7b73`, PR-1 squash
`57f3fe64`, PR-1 old tip `075a208e`, and PR-2 at its **actual** tip (see below).

